# Stop Cold has flash (CR 702.8a) and enchants a creature: Bot1 casts it in Bot2's end step on Bot2's Ornithopter (CR 303.4). The
# enters trigger taps it (CR 603.1), it loses Flying (CR 613.1f), and it stays tapped through Bot2's next untap step on turn 4
# (CR 502.3) - holding it down after the trigger has long resolved.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Stop Cold
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

